{"thread":{"threadID":3650,"boardID":117,"topic":"20.06.2016 Admin Team","time":1466450109,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1466632486,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":7,"views":751,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":6},"tags":[{"tagID":9,"name":"admin"},{"tagID":47,"name":"team"}],"posts":[{"postID":48108,"threadID":3650,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"20.06.2016 Admin Team","time":1466450109,"lastEditTime":1466859900,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1466450234,"value":1},{"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","time":1466450291,"value":1},{"userID":2141,"username":"Holy Moly","time":1466450675,"value":1},{"userID":2190,"username":"KnAWLeDGE","time":1466450759,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1466452720,"value":1},{"userID":2198,"username":"Raven","time":1466550717,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1466858906,"value":1},{"userID":2228,"username":"Craex","time":1466604648,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p></div><p><strong>Oxygen did not pass his Test-Admin time</strong><br>He was removed from the team because of an unusual amount of reports from other players accusing him of abuse, unfair kicks / bans and more.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Since we&#x27;ve made an exception and accepted him even though he is only 15 years old, he didn&#x27;t show us his maturity, but instead started useless fun votes, which he first denied on the TeamSpeak but later on kind of confirmed since we had concrete evidence for his actions.<br>However, thanks for trying to help and improve Dream, it means a lot to us.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Fiddles was removed from the Admin team</strong><br>Fiddles had recieved multiple warnings from us regarding his actions of the last few weeks but the recent event with the pictured admin abuse made us reevaluate him. Similar to Oxygen, there were quite too many complaints against him in recent times and along with some other reasons, we decided that he is no longer compatible with the team.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We still thank you for your continuous support of almost half a year and and your will to help out Dream. I hope you have a good time, wherever you go or might do next.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":48111,"threadID":3650,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1466452710,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1466453133,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1466455161,"value":1},{"userID":2141,"username":"Holy Moly","time":1466460772,"value":1},{"userID":2228,"username":"Craex","time":1466604659,"value":1},{"userID":1841,"username":"Max <3","time":1466605632,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Genau wie <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1841-max-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Max &lt;3</a> in den ersten Tagen nicht bestanden  <span class=\"missing-media\">[smile*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":48153,"threadID":3650,"userID":2228,"username":"Craex","subject":"","time":1466604697,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1466610787,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>finde es schade das oxygen kein admin geworden ist es hat seine gründe aber er war voll gut drauf</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":48154,"threadID":3650,"userID":1841,"username":"Max <3","subject":"","time":1466605618,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>KAMIKATZE</stro